  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-cdeylzj1icg000\">根据创建订阅任务时设置的触发规则条件，订阅账户下存在触发事件时则会根据设定间隔进行推送（<strong>创建任务时无间隔设置提醒则为实时变动推送</strong>）</p><h1 data-id=\"h2bn51pwk-5oaz88egxsc000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-a22w82bcasw00\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3aygljd7zp0000\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 data-id=\"h8d467kkg-5nqx5xlfp40000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-7chx953w34g00\">关联API接口</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-3ufhn7fjdyy000\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1741387668314126\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1741387668314126</a></p><h1 data-id=\"hge6xxm94-40yxl5dalvy000\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-iokhgp4hehs00\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-2cirsrws8mdc00\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"hn8ke7qcg-19tdv1bldruo00\" id=\"h4kgw8yp6-czk2e3sxzww00\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"header\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" width=\"250\" style=\"width: 250px;\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" width=\"120\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.c